{% block content %}
<main id="main-content"><section class="page-hero compact-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Trust and Accessibility</p><h1>Accessibility Statement</h1><p>Making learning easier to perceive, navigate, and understand</p></section><section class="legal-shell"><article class="legal-card">
<p class="legal-note"><strong>Last updated: 15 July 2026.</strong> Athanas Inspires is committed to improving access for learners using different devices, connection speeds, keyboards, assistive technologies, and motion preferences.</p>
<h2>Current accessibility features</h2><ul><li>Skip-to-content navigation and semantic page landmarks.</li><li>Keyboard-visible focus indicators and accessible navigation controls.</li><li>Strong text contrast improvements across light and dark sections.</li><li>Reduced-motion support for visitors who prefer fewer animations.</li><li>Manual play and pause controls for welcome audio and testimonials.</li><li>Written transcripts for welcome audio messages.</li><li>Alternative text for meaningful website images.</li><li>Responsive layouts for phones, tablets, and computers.</li></ul>
<h2>Known limitations</h2><p>Some third-party YouTube, WhatsApp, or embedded content may have accessibility behaviour controlled by the external provider. Older website sections may still require continued refinement.</p>
<h2>Request assistance</h2><p>If a page, lesson, file, or tool is difficult to use, contact Athanas Inspires through <a href="contact.html">the contact page</a>. Please describe the page, device, browser, and difficulty so the issue can be investigated.</p></article></section></main>
